          "rows": [
            {
              "cells": [
                "Circle / Ellipse / Arc / Rect",
                "Parameterized shapes with mutable dimensions",
                "Convenient geometric bounds and specialization"
              ]
            },
            {
              "cells": [
                "Line / Poly",
                "Linear points, polygons and streaming vertices",
                "Useful for changing point data and compute extrusion"
              ]
            },
            {
              "cells": [
                "Path",
                "SVG d, point arrays, contours, source paths or GPU buffers",
                "Rich curves, modifiers and analytical/fast rendering"
              ]
            },
            {
              "cells": [
                "Bezier / Spline",
                "Control points plus evaluation options",
                "Curve sampling and interpolation"
              ]
            },
            {
              "cells": [
                "SDF2D / SDFCircle / Shader",
                "Implicit or custom GPU shading",
                "Specialized shader contracts"
              ]
            },
            {
              "cells": [
                "Sprite / Mesh2D",
                "Texture or explicit indexed geometry",
                "Different geometry/resource lifecycle"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Exact contracts: [Circle](/api-entities-primitives-2d#circle), [Ellipse](/api-entities-primitives-2d#ellipse), [Arc](/api-entities-primitives-2d#arc), [Rect](/api-entities-primitives-2d#rect), [Line](/api-entities-primitives-2d#line), [Poly](/api-entities-primitives-2d#poly), [Path](/api-entities-primitives-2d#path), [Bezier](/api-entities-primitives-2d#bezier), [Spline](/api-entities-primitives-2d#spline), [Shader](/api-entities-primitives-2d#shader)."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "For parsing, allocation, compute, stencil filling and triangulation, read [how paths reach the GPU](/path-pipelines)."
        }
      ]
